    "Welcome to Team SISTAR Company — your gateway to a global ecosystem of innovation, AI-driven collaboration, and shared success. This guide walks you through everything you need to know: from our vision and culture to your onboarding checklist and master agreement.": "欢迎加入 Team SISTAR Company —— 通往集创新、AI 驱动协作与共赢成功于一体的全球生态系统的门户。本指南将全面介绍您所需了解的一切关键事项：涵盖企业愿景与文化、入职 Checklist 及主协议（Master Agreement）。",
    "Innovating Together, Growing Stronger": "协同创新，共筑卓越",
    "SISTAR Company is a dynamic project company developing innovative products, services, and IT solutions through the power of collaboration and advanced AI technology. We are an \"Idea Factory\" fueled by creative concepts, strategic investment, and cutting-edge automation — transforming bold ideas into global market realities.": "SISTAR Company 是一家极具活力的项目制公司（Project Company），依托协作力量与先进 AI 技术，持续研发创新型产品、服务及 IT 解决方案。我们是以创意概念、战略投资及前沿自动化为驱动力的“Idea Factory”——将极具前瞻性的构想切实转化为全球市场成果。",
    "Our Business Philosophy": "经营哲学",
    "SISTAR's culture is built on four actionable principles that guide how we work, build, and grow — both individually and collectively.": "SISTAR 的企业文化建立在四大核心行动准则之上，旨在全面指导我们在个人及组织层面如何协同工作、构建生态与实现增长。",
    "Optimized Working Environment & Member Benefits": "优化办公环境与成员福利",
    "We provide a futuristic, AI-enhanced workspace designed around productivity, flexibility, and professional growth. Whether working from home or at a SISTAR Base, every Challenger has access to world-class digital infrastructure.": "我们提供以卓越生产力、高度灵活性与职业成长为核心设计的未来主义 AI 赋能工作空间。无论远程办公还是在 SISTAR Base 实地办公，每位 Challenger 均享有世界一流的数字化基础设施支持。",
    "Member Benefits at a Glance": "核心成员权益一览",
    "Shared Budget": "Shared Budget",
    "Up to 30% of project profits set aside for the team.": "项目利润中最高可达 30% 划拨为团队共享激励预算。",
    "Contract Term": "合同期限",
    "Initial contract duration, extendable for another 6 months.": "初始合同期限，期满后可协商延期 6 个月。",
    "Individual Cap": "个人分配上限 (Individual Cap)",
    "Maximum individual share from the shared budget per project.": "单个项目中个人可从 shared budget 中获取的最大收益配额。",
    "Payment Date": "结算支付日",
    "Monthly payments processed on the 25th of each month.": "月度结算款项于每月 25 日统筹核发。",
    "AI-Powered Workflow": "AI 驱动工作流",
