    "SISTAR Studio serves as the institutional interface connecting global investors, manufacturing partners, regional wholesalers, and media audiences with the *SC (SISTAR Company) universe - backed by 100% completed cloud/AI infrastructure and verifiable daily NAV auditing.": "SISTAR Studio 作为机构级对接平台，将全球投资者、制造合作伙伴、区域批发商以及媒体受众与 *SC (SISTAR Company) 商业生态无缝连接——以 100% 部署就绪的云端/AI 基础设施及每日可审计核验的 NAV 机制为坚实依托。",
    "The SISTAR Post serves as the institutional interface connecting global investors, manufacturing partners, regional wholesalers, and media audiences with the *SC (SISTAR Company) universe - backed by 100% completed cloud/AI infrastructure and verifiable daily NAV auditing.": "The SISTAR Post 作为机构级对接平台，将全球投资者、制造合作伙伴、区域批发商以及媒体受众与 *SC (SISTAR Company) 商业生态无缝连接——以 100% 部署就绪的云端/AI 基础设施及每日可审计核验的 NAV 机制为坚实依托。",
